# Save the level as it stands, with the Wall of Fire the probe left up (INCURSION_WALL_SAVE=1).
# Used by tools/check_effect_motion.sh stage W3. ESC opens the System Menu, [b] is Save and Continue
# (see the header of tools/keys/save-continue.keys). The run needs no turn of its own: the probe's cast is one.
ESC
@expect "System Menu"
b
@dump:saved
